URL:https://www.billetweb.fr/musee-carnavalet-tour
DESCRIPTION:Venue: 23 Rue de Sévigné\, 75003 Paris\nDiscover the history 
 of Paris with ESN Paris! Join us for a cultural afternoon exploring the Mu
 sée Carnavalet\, the oldest museum in the city\, located in the heart of 
 the Marais district. Wander through magnificent period rooms and fascinati
 ng collections tracing the history of the capital from prehistory to the p
 resent day. It is a fantastic opportunity to discover Parisian heritage\, 
 learn something new\, and meet other international students in a friendly 
 atmosphere.\n\nhttps://www.billetweb.fr/musee-carnavalet-tour
END:VEVENT
