SUMMARY:Musée de Cluny Visit
LOCATION:28 Rue du Sommerard\, 75005 Paris
URL:https://www.billetweb.fr/musee-de-cluny-visit
DESCRIPTION:Venue: 28 Rue du Sommerard\, 75005 Paris\nVisit the Musée de C
 luny and discover the world's most iconic alchemist with ESN Paris! Locate
 d in the heart of the Latin Quarter and nearly as old as Paris\, the now-m
 useum has served as Roman baths\, as an abbey\, as a palace and even as st
 orage for the city’s sculptures. Nowadays\, it specialises in medieval h
 istory. We invite you to discover its temporary exhibition about the real 
 history of Nicolas Flamel\, a figure that has inspired our literature and 
 pop culture. The event is free for UE citizens between 16-25 years old. We
  recommend the other visitors who don’t have their free entry to buy the
 ir ticket in advance at the official website: https://billetterie.musee-mo
 yenage.fr/fr/collection-permanente\n\nhttps://www.billetweb.fr/musee-de-cl
 uny-visit
END:VEVENT
