SUMMARY:Montmartre City Tour
LOCATION:Abbesses\, Paris\, France
URL:https://www.billetweb.fr/montmartre-city-tour
DESCRIPTION:Venue: Abbesses\, Paris\, France\nESN Paris takes you to the Mo
 ntmartre district of Paris! The hilltop neighbourhood of Montmartre\, Pari
 s\, is one of the city’s most popular tourist spots. Until 1860 it was j
 ust outside Paris’ city but under the act of extension of the city\, it 
 became the 18th arrondissement of Paris. During the Belle Époque\, many a
 rtists lived in\, had studios or worked in Montmartre\, including Modiglia
 ni\, Claude Monet and Pierre-Auguste Renoir. Sunday 29th of November\, com
 e with us to discover the famous Wall of Love\, the imposing Basilica of t
 he Sacré-Coeur\, Place du Tertre and all the charming streets that have m
 ade Montmartre one of the most poetic places in the world! ????\n\nhttps:/
 /www.billetweb.fr/montmartre-city-tour
END:VEVENT
